      "text": "Platform admins (Gab, Noah)\n\nWork at alumninetwork.ca/console, with MFA.\n\nThe console shows counts per school, never alumni personal data.\n\nTo see a school's data, open a support grant: reason + max 8 h. The school's admins see it in their audit log.",
