      "page": "alumni",
      "text": "Account ≠ admission\n\nJoin now → Create account → Confirm email by link → Request alumni access → School review.\n\nAccount creation alone grants no alumni membership or directory access. Only the school reviewer can admit the applicant.\n\nSign in uses email + password. Code sign-in is hidden; its old frame is in Archive.\n\nScreens added 2026-11-01 as a design proposal. Application implementation waits for design review.",
